Unleash your subconscious on the world around you.  While active, you fire up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] bolts each turn (one per hostile target) that deal [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage.  Each bolt consumes 5 Feedback.

Feedback gains beyond your maximum allowed amount may generate extra bolts (one bolt per [19, 18, 17, 16, 15 (TL1-5)] excess Feedback per target), but no more than [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] extra bolts per turn.

This effect is a psionic channel, increasing the range of Mind Sear, Psychic Lobotomy, and Sunder Mind to 10 but will break if you move.

The damage will scale with your Mindpower.
